<lb n="8"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßers</unclear> hindersessen wegen zuogeschriben, und
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verkhundt</unclear>, daß haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ablesent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehoert</unclear>, und
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuoen</unclear> uns auch der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnaeigten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erinnerung</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>und berichtens gantz frundtlich bedanckhen, mit
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderigem</unclear> Erbietten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soliches</unclear> in dergleichen od andern
<lb n="13"/>begebenheiten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverschulden</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverdienen</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ollen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear> Euch frundtlich nit verhalten, daß
